{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是文化之日，放假。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『愛理來了。』", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0372", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，這樣啊……沒注意到。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我打掃房間的時候，瀨名來找櫻乃玩了。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名，今天沒有打工嗎……？」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過櫻乃會找朋友來家裡還真稀奇，瀨名是第一個。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我還是窩在房間不要打擾她們比較好吧……", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不對，我應該出門比較好嗎……？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "思考了幾分鐘後，我來到廚房準備茶水。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其實我剛才已經換好外出服走到玄關了。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過認識的人來家裡，不打聲招呼也說不過去……好。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我記得家裡有餅乾，一起端過去好了……", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾了……」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是，我單手拿著托盤來到櫻乃的房間。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我才是打擾了。」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0728", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，謝謝。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0373", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒什麼啦，畢竟是認識的人來家裡……」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼說來，我也好久沒來櫻乃的房間了。來瀨名，請喝茶。」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝……你是說真的？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0729", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接下我遞出的杯子，瀨名有點訝異地歪著頭。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她穿著便服。這副打扮，除了初次見面以外還是第一次看到。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "依然是俐落謹慎的感覺。完全看不出她在自己家裡會穿運動服和棉袍。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我以為你們在家裡也很融洽……」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0730", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「基本上是來我房間，對吧櫻乃？」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0374", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同樣接過茶的櫻乃，像平常一樣文靜地點了點頭。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了，妳的書忘在我房間裡了喔。我等一下拿過來。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用。我沒有忘記。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0375", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「後續的內容，我還會去哥哥房間看。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0376", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯嗯，原來如此。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是這樣。我對瀨名聳了聳肩。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……在學校和家裡都是這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0731", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，說的也是。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0732", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理解了之後，瀨名微笑著點點頭。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她稍微舉高杯子。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就喝囉，瓜生。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0733", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，趁熱喝吧。我就先走了，妳們慢慢聊……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，等一下。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0734", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我本來想立刻就離開，但她卻叫住我。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……瓜、瓜生等一下有什麼預定嗎？」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0735", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？沒什麼特別的預定啊……」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然如此，反正機會難得，你多待一會吧？只端茶來就走，太冷淡了吧？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0736", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唉。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，可以嗎？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0737", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0377", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那哥哥的茶我去泡吧。」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0378", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「麻煩妳了。坐下吧，瓜生。」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0738", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然不是很懂這個發展……", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那妳可以坐過去一點嗎，瀨名？」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我又沒有叫你坐我旁邊！」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0739", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的瀨名也是立刻就對我的玩笑精準反擊。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之，拒絕恐怕會弄僵氣氛，於是我就留下來陪她們喝茶了。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然不是坐在瀨名旁邊。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，我沒想到走到櫻乃的家要花這麼多時間。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0740", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為去久米超市的路已經走習慣了，我以為距離超市只要５分鐘路程，應該沒問題的……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0741", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到習慣為止，認路是一場戰鬥。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0379", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的呢……只要習慣就好了，不過在那之前是個問題。」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0742", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名對於第一次來的地方果然是迷路了啊……我一邊猜想一邊喝茶。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為我只是陪喝茶的，所以很安分地在一旁默默聽著。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0380", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此時，櫻乃把話題拋給我。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「教我們不會迷路的訣竅。」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0381", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "居然問這麼難的問題啊，妹妹。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說得也是，我也想知道呢，『哥哥』。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0743", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「常常聽人家說男人與女人的大腦本質不同──對吧，櫻乃？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0744", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0382", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是那樣，這兩個人的迷路本事也過於驚人了。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，這個嘛……嗯～」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算不認識路，只要知道方位……呃，大概就明白了吧？」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能明白的話就不用這麼辛苦了。」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0745", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「前方是北方。」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0383", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「未免太不明白了吧！」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0746", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「上面是北方才對。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0747", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0384", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我懂方位，但我完全不懂這兩個人說的話……", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那個瀨名，從久米超市到我家，妳是怎麼來的？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃傳了報路的郵件給我。」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0748", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個。」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0385", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我看看……？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是傳了有沿路指示的地圖嗎……我一邊猜一邊看向她遞出的手機。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『久米超市出來後往斜前方走。香菸店前的紅綠燈過馬路後往右。遇到紅色屋頂的住宅往左轉──』", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0386", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我照郵件上說的，在香菸店前的紅綠燈過馬路後轉彎了，可是……」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理大概是在有很多自動販賣機的地方轉彎了。」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0387", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「騙人！？那裡不是香菸店嗎？」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那個啊，今後妳要去沒去過的地方時，或許先在網路上查一下街景比較好……」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我家沒有電腦……為了這個要去一趟學校也太累人了。」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，就算看了，不實際去一趟也不知道。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0388", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「的確……不知道呢。在走到出現『就是那條路！』的感覺為止，實在搞不清楚方向……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯。」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0389", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對於腦中就自帶地圖的我來說，此時的氣氛就好像被排擠一樣……", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是說……嗯。她們聊迷路聊得這麼起勁，我差不多該退場比較好吧？", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我差不多該……」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當我站起來的時候。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼？」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被瞪了一眼所以又坐下了。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然又坐下了……但我才想問，為什麼啊？", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過櫻乃有『哥哥』會來找妳，所以很安心吧。」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0390", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果又有什麼事，就麻煩了。」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0391", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這當然沒問題，可是……」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……呵呵。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0755", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那之後。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我差不多該出去了。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "（盯。）", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0756", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……櫻乃，我重新泡茶來吧？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳們慢慢聊。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瞪。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 2, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0757", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，你一下站一下坐好忙。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0392", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，今天打擾了。」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0758", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果，我直到最後都在陪她們聊天。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，掰掰。」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0393", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我會再來的。」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0759", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生明天見。」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar0760", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名看著並肩而站目送她的我和櫻乃，不知道為什麼好像很心滿意足的樣子。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……因為我跟櫻乃感情很好嗎？", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0394", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，沒什麼。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我只是在想該不該送她回去。瀨名還不習慣這附近的路吧？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她說今天有把時間空下來了，會邊迷路邊記路。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": "sk0395", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……設想得真是周到。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她今天是特地來看「我們」的嗎……", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
